the value of million for value a value is a value input if
    the value input = value * 1000000.

the value of billion for value a value is a value input if
    the value of million for value the value is a second value input
    and the value input = second value input * 1000.

the value of trillion for value a value is a value input if
    the value of billion for value the value is a second value input
    and the value input = second value input * 1000.

the value of performance period years is 10 if
    .

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is equal to 1
    and the value of trillion for value 2 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number >= 2
    and the tranche number <= 10
    and the value of trillion for value 2 is a value input
    and a thing = tranche number - 1
    and the value of billion for value 500 is a second value input
    and a second thing = thing * second value input
    and the value = value input + second thing.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number < 2
    and the tranche number is equal to 11
    and the value of trillion for value 7.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number < 2
    and the tranche number is different from 11
    and the tranche number is equal to 12
    and the value of trillion for value 8.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is 0 if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number < 2
    and the tranche number is different from 11
    and the tranche number is different from 12.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number > 10
    and the tranche number is equal to 11
    and the value of trillion for value 7.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number > 10
    and the tranche number is different from 11
    and the tranche number is equal to 12
    and the value of trillion for value 8.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is 0 if
    the tranche number is different from 1
    and the tranche number > 10
    and the tranche number is different from 11
    and the tranche number is different from 12.

